  "note": "Election of the members retiring by rotation, held on Monday 16 January 1905. Smyth (styled J.P.), John Hughes and Bernard Hughes were old members and Thomas Shields new; \"Mr. Shields was the defeated candidate\". The Armagh Guardian calls it \"the election of four Town Commissioners\"; with four candidates and one defeated, three seats were filled. No party labels are printed."
